{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "description": "Boundary i64/u64 literals box through box_int64_value / box_uint64_value (Stack API #25). RV14 (2026-08-15): the caller no longer adopts the result into a home \u2014 a C helper owns no watermark, so its wide payload rides the number stack for the activation. The boxing calls are the invariant; the adopt is forbidden.",
